	measure 'Period Label' = ```
			VAR _s = CALCULATE ( MIN ( Transactions[Date] ) )
			VAR _e = CALCULATE ( MAX ( Transactions[Date] ) )
			RETURN FORMAT ( _s, "d mmm yyyy" ) & "  –  " & FORMAT ( _e, "d mmm yyyy" )
			```
		displayFolder: UX
